#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84_Chatty Guy"
msgid "Hey, pal, you hear some shit's going down with the loan shark\\r\nwho lives here?"
msgstr "Oye, amigo, ¿has oído que hay problemas con el prestamista\\r\nque vive aquí?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "96_Kiryu"
msgid "I didn't even know there <Italic>was</Italic> a loan shark here."
msgstr "Ni siquiera sabía que <Italic>había</Italic> un prestamista aquí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "108_Chatty Guy"
msgid "Oh yeah, up on the top floor. Sounds like the cops are\\r\nfinally cracking down on him, though."
msgstr "Ah, sí, arriba, en el último piso. Parece que al fin le cayó\\r\nla ley."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "120_Kiryu"
msgid "Why, what did he do?"
msgstr "¿Por qué? ¿Qué hizo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "132_Chatty Guy"
msgid "Dunno! I bet it was something nice and meaty, though. They\\r\nwere carrying out tons of stuff from his place!"
msgstr "Pues, no estoy muy seguro, pero vi que estaban sacando un\\r\nmontón de cosas del local. ¡Seguro que hicieron algo turbio!"

